{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfPy3jrjKCbqMdJXjFxHy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my analysis of the repository, here is the complete mapping of read paths and values for ticket BE-005:\n\n## Read paths\n\n| Path | Value | Stored or Computed | Where Computed |\n|------|-------|-------------------|-----------------|\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | orderId | Stored | Order entity |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | customerId | Stored | Order entity |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | amount | Stored | Order entity |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | currency | Stored | Order entity |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | quantity | Stored | Order entity |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | fulfilment.allocated | Computed | OrderController sums non-CANCELLED shipments' quantities via ShipmentRepository |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | fulfilment.delivered | Computed | OrderController sums DELIVERED shipments' quantities via ShipmentRepository |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | fulfilment.status | Computed | OrderController determines from allocated vs delivered vs order.quantity |\n| GET /orders?limit=X&offset=Y&fulfilment=STATUS | (same fields as above for each order) | Mixed | Order fields stored; fulfilment computed per order |\n| GET /orders?limit=X&offset=Y&fulfilment=STATUS | X-Total-Count (header) | Computed | OrderController counts filtered orders before pagination |\n| PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity | quantity | Stored | Order entity (updated from request) |\n| PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity | (fulfilment fields) | Computed | OrderController recomputes after quantity update |\n| POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm | shipmentId | Stored | Shipment entity |\n| POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm | orderId | Stored | Shipment entity |\n| POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm | carrier | Stored | Shipment entity |\n| POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm | status | Stored | Shipment entity (transitioned to CONFIRMED) |\n| POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm | quantity | Stored | Shipment entity |\n| POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver | status | Stored | Shipment entity (transitioned to DELIVERED) |\n| POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel | status | Stored | Shipment entity (transitioned to CANCELLED) |\n| GET /shipments/{shipmentId} | (all Shipment fields) | Stored | Shipment entity |\n| GET /shipments?limit=X&offset=Y | (all Shipment fields for each) | Stored | Shipment entity |\n| GET /shipments?limit=X&offset=Y | X-Total-Count (header) | Computed | ShipmentController counts all shipments before pagination |\n| GET /customers/{customerId} | customerId | Stored | Customer entity |\n| GET /customers/{customerId} | name | Stored | Customer entity |\n| GET /customers/{customerId} | email | Stored | Customer entity |\n| GET /customers?limit=X&offset=Y | (all Customer fields for each) | Stored | Customer entity |\n| GET /customers?limit=X&offset=Y | X-Total-Count (header) | Computed | CustomerController counts all customers before pagination |\n\n## Shape\n\nOrder responses include fulfillment state computed on read by aggregating associated shipments from the repository; shipments and customers are read directly from storage; pagination headers reflect counts before slicing.\n\n## Unresolved\n\nNone — all read paths and their values can be definitively classified as stored in repositories or computed in controllers through aggregation/transformation at response time.\n\n---\n\n**Relevant file paths:**\n\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-53af3571-f75b-4a2e-9a7c-57f8214b0da5/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderController.kt` — will implement query parameter filtering, pagination, and fulfilment object computation\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-53af3571-f75b-4a2e-9a7c-57f8214b0da5/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/Order.kt` — will add `quantity` field and `Fulfilment` data class\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-53af3571-f75b-4a2e-9a7c-57f8214b0da5/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderRepository.kt` — will add filter/pagination methods\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-53af3571-f75b-4a2e-9a7c-57f8214b0da5/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt` — will add confirm/deliver/cancel endpoints and pagination\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-53af3571-f75b-4a2e-9a7c-57f8214b0da5/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/Shipment.kt` — will add `quantity` field and `DELIVERED` status\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-53af3571-f75b-4a2e-9a7c-57f8214b0da5/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentRepository.kt` — will add pagination methods\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-53af3571-f75b-4a2e-9a7c-57f8214b0da5/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/customer/CustomerController.kt` — will add error envelope for 404 and pagination\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-53af3571-f75b-4a2e-9a7c-57f8214b0da5/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/customer/CustomerRepository.kt` — will add pagination methods\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-53af3571-f75b-4a2e-9a7c-57f8214b0da5/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiExceptions.kt` — will add `UnprocessableEntityException` for customer validation (422 error)\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-53af3571-f75b-4a2e-9a7c-57f8214b0da5/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt` — will add error codes for customer validation and quantity validatio